# Friends Included Finance

A web dashboard and Telegram bot for recording sales and expenses in the Friends Included wedding-business case.

## Live project

https://friends-included-finance-gtlg.vercel.app

## Features

- Sales form with commission shares that must total 100%.
- Role-based interface for salespeople, expense reporter, and manager.
- Records stored in Supabase.
- Sales also append to the linked Google Sheets Sales tab.
- Telegram commands: `/start`, `/help`, and `/sale Customer | A or B | amount | description`.

## Demo flow

1. Open the website and choose Richard, Anastasia, or Jean-Claude.
2. Submit a sale; it is stored as `pending`.
3. Send the same kind of sale through Telegram, for example:
   `/sale Olivia Rose | A | 1200 | Wedding planning deposit`.
4. Check the record in Supabase and the Google Sales sheet.

## Telegram setup

The Vercel project holds the bot token privately. To activate the bot, configure its webhook to point to:

`https://friends-included-finance-gtlg.vercel.app/api/telegram`

No secret keys are stored in this repository.
